  "ruleText": "Nat 301.05 “Doctor of naturopathic medicine (ND)” means “doctor of naturopathic medicine” as defined in RSA 328-E:2, IV, namely, “a person authorized and licensed to practice naturopathic medicine under this chapter.”\n\nSource. #6380, eff 11-26-96, EXPIRED: 11-26-04\n\nNew. #8374, eff 6-18-05, EXPIRED: 6-18-13\n\nNew. #12176, eff 5-17-17",
